<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Warlock third-party licenses</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: light dark;
    --bg: #fbfaf7;
    --fg: #1d1b1a;
    --muted: #6a6560;
    --rule: #d9d4cc;
    --code-bg: #f1eee8;
    --link: #1f5fa8;
  }
  @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    :root {
      --bg: #151413;
      --fg: #e6e1d8;
      --muted: #9a948a;
      --rule: #3a3733;
      --code-bg: #1e1c1a;
      --link: #7fb0ea;
    }
  }
  body {
    margin: 0 auto;
    max-width: 62rem;
    padding: 1.5rem 16px 4rem;
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--fg);
    font: 16px/1.5 system-ui, sans-serif;
  }
  a { color: var(--link); }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 0.5rem; }
  h2 { font-size: 1.2rem; margin: 2rem 0 0.5rem; }
  h3 { font-size: 1.05rem; margin: 0 0 0.25rem; }
  .muted { color: var(--muted); }
  .overview { padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .license { border-top: 1px solid var(--rule); padding-top: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
  .crates { columns: 16rem; column-gap: 1.5rem; margin: 0.5rem 0 1rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; }
  .crates li { break-inside: avoid; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
  pre {
    background: var(--code-bg);
    padding: 0.75rem;
    overflow-x: auto;
    font: 0.8rem/1.4 ui-monospace, monospace;
    white-space: pre-wrap;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<h1>Warlock third-party licenses</h1>
<p>
  Warlock is free software under the GNU General Public License, version 3 (see
  <a href="https://github.com/jannef/warlock/blob/main/LICENSE">LICENSE</a>). It is built from the
  open-source components listed below, for the Linux, Windows, macOS, and web builds. Each
  component is distributed under the license and copyright notice shown here.
</p>

<h2>Fonts</h2>
<p>
  The game embeds the <a href="https://juliamono.netlify.app/">JuliaMono</a> font, copyright
  The JuliaMono Project Authors, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (<code>JuliaMono-OFL.txt</code> in the release archives).
</p>
<p>
  The spell circles' runes are drawn with a subset of
  <a href="https://fonts.google.com/noto/specimen/Noto+Sans+JP">Noto Sans JP</a> Medium, copyright
  2014-2021 Adobe, licensed under the SIL Open Font License 1.1
  (<code>NotoSansJP-OFL.txt</code> in the release archives).
</p>

<h2>Rust crates: overview</h2>
<p class="muted">Counts are crates; a crate offering several licenses is listed under each.</p>
<ul class="overview">
{{#each overview}}
  <li><a href="#lic-{{indices.[0]}}">{{name}}</a> ({{id}}): {{count}}</li>
{{/each}}
</ul>

<h2>Rust crates: license texts</h2>
{{#each licenses}}
<section class="license" id="lic-{{@index}}">
  <h3>{{name}}</h3>
  <p class="muted">Used by:</p>
  <ul class="crates">
  {{#each used_by}}
    <li>{{#if crate.repository}}<a href="{{crate.repository}}">{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}</a>{{else}}{{crate.name}} {{crate.version}}{{/if}}</li>
  {{/each}}
  </ul>
  <pre>{{text}}</pre>
</section>
{{/each}}
</body>
</html>
